	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quid mihi rescripseris, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>doctissime et in Christo unice observande <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>frater <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, hauddum vidi; tu vide, cui <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>commiseris.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">At <persName>Heinius</persName> noster kalendis martiarum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ad nos veniens plaustrum fere attulit epistolarum, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ab <placeName ref="l2">Arauensibus</placeName> scilicet et <placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName> ac <placeName ref="l335">Mylhusanis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Tuas non vidi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Fuit etiamnum apud me dominus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p3099">Sulczerus</persName> eo die, quo charissima mea uxor humana <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>exuit, quam et verbo gratię, priusquam obiret, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>solatus est, postea et dominus <persName>Ioannes</persName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> diaconus, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p8384">Hospiniani</persName> nostri gener, cum paedotriba, atqui <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nullus mihi aliquid dedit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hęrent ergo vel <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l2">Aroę</placeName> vel <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> aut perierunt etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Quod attinet concordiam eucharistię, credo me <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>priori aliqua epistola significasse, hoc scilicet: "Par<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>turient montes" etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p4183">Iacobus enim Andreę</persName> edidit <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>libellum, cui <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> pręfatur etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Conatus bonus homo summa diligentia, mirabili et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nova theologia utrasque partes pacificare omniumque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>scripta utrinque aedita concordare.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Atque u<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>cunque habeas gustum seraphiei doctoris, ita scribit: <foreign xml:lang="de">"<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Wan man dich fragt, waß issest im nachtmal, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>so sag: ich iß den leib Christi leiplichen und geistlichen" <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>etc.</foreign></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si habes, legisti forte.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Videtur ergo <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mihi id responsi satis esse absurdum, imo multo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>potius minus explicatum, atque quo magis vult <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>simplitium animos certos facere, hoc magis dissipat <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>isto responso.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Certo consistat, tametsi non omnes, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tamen <foreign xml:lang="de">die ruwen Sachsen</foreign> istam doctrinam cons<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>puere abhorrentes a spirituali manducatione etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Itidem, qui apud nostros recte instituti sunt <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>et insueti vocabulorum <foreign xml:lang="de">leiblichen und wesentlich,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>item: <foreign xml:lang="de">"Christus ist im brot, neben brot etc. mit <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>dem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>brot,</foreign> quid cogitabunt?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Si hac verborum diversitate <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>possumus coire, merito dicemus saltare <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>camelum etc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Metuo autem bonum virum malam <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>reportaturum gratiam ab utrisque partibus, imo <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>forte peiorem quam <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName>, qui doctrinam <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>iustificationis inter <persName ref="p2301">Osiandrum</persName> et academiam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><placeName ref="l268">Konigspergianam</placeName> componere voluit neutraliter etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Utinam liceret mihi tecum coram conferre de hisce <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>rebus, quę angustia epistolaris non sinit scribere.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Quantis superstitionibus ecclesię marchionatus, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>vicini nostri, obruantur, olim audies.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Conventus principum brevi solvetur, ut pecunia <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>emulgeatur a civibus ad expeditionem <placeName ref="l2510">Turcicam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Religionis negotium tractabitur in colloquio novo, <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>si successerit, aut <placeName ref="l491">Strasburgi</placeName> aut <placeName ref="l410">Regionospurgi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>vel <placeName ref="l18">Augustę Vindelicorum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Collocutores erunt <persName ref="p2095">Philippus <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Melanchthon</persName>, <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> et alii, item <persName ref="p7091">Vicelius</persName> Iesuita <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>quidam ac nescio qui alii.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Adfirmant <persName ref="p2095">Philippum Melanchthonem</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>venturum <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName> illicque aedes pro sene paratas.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z23"/><placeName ref="l513">Ulmenses</placeName> cum <placeName ref="l18">Augustanis</placeName> polliciti sunt <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>Romano regi doctri<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>nam interim se non mutaturos.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Summa: Christus vilescit proceribus ac toti <placeName ref="l822">Ger<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>manię</placeName> fere; sumus enim saturi, <foreign xml:lang="de">ja gar matt.</foreign></s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>O bone deus, respice nos etc.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, mi frater <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>in Christo, et ecclesiam tuam et nostram, ut facis, <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>commendatam habeas orans, ne tentemur supra id, <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>quod ferre possumus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis fratres omnes cum d<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>omesticis.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 13. <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>martii 1557. ad lucernam.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Alias plura.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z34"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>capularis senex<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Eximio simul et pietate ac <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>eruditione viro optimo d. <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurina/o<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>rum</placeName> ecclesiarum theologo <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>et antistiti, suo domino obser<lb xml:id="p4z6"/>vando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
